<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">I’m writing
to invite your school&nbsp;to partner with the&nbsp;American&nbsp;Red
Cross&nbsp;through&nbsp;our&nbsp;high school blood program.&nbsp;Your decision
to host a Red Cross blood drive teaches your students the important role that
blood donations play in ensuring a ready blood supply, which is critical to the
treatment of cancer patients, accident victims and unforeseen trauma
situations.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;user-select: text;
-webkit-user-drag: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></b></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">Benefits
of a Red Cross&nbsp;High School&nbsp;Blood Program partnership:</span></b></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;vertical-align:
baseline"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:
Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">A meaningful
opportunity for your students to help save lives.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;vertical-align:
baseline"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:
Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Educational
presentation, curriculum&nbsp;or&nbsp;classroom activities for a student
learn-in-action experience.&nbsp;</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;vertical-align:
baseline"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:
Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Leadership
opportunities for students to&nbsp;</span></span><span class="advancedproofingissue"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">take
action</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial">&nbsp;by volunteering on a blood drive committee or</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">giving&nbsp;blood
at your blood drive.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:
Arial">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;vertical-align:
baseline"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:
Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Your school will be recognized for helping
save </span></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">lives, with the opportunity to earn a scholarship for your school
to award to a student recipient!&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;
margin-left:.5in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">I hope you
will partner with the Red Cross&nbsp;for a lifesaving blood drive
program&nbsp;which&nbsp;can help you accomplish this mission and bring
students, faculty and the community together&nbsp;to help change someone’s life
with every single donation you collect.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;user-select: text;
-webkit-user-drag: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent"><span class="normaltextrun"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">Contact
me&nbsp;today&nbsp;and&nbsp;let’s save lives together.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;user-select: text;
-webkit-user-drag: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent"><span class="normaltextrun"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">Sincerely,</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">P.S.&nbsp;Do
you have friends or family who are involved in leading student organizations
around your community that might be interested in a youth blood program? If so,
please forward this email to encourage others to get involved!</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>]]></td>
